<A NAME=beginning> <CENTER> <H1>Cyran's list of BatMUD's Items</H1> </CENTER> </A>
<HR width=600>

<UL TYPE=square>
<BR>
<BR>This list dates back to 1995.  Check out the stat boosts on some of these items!  Tune.. tune.. tune.. and more tune.
<br>
<BR>
<LI> <A HREF=#Head> Head </A>
<LI> <A HREF=#Neck> Neck </A> 
